comments.body:
@anonymous-31, In addition to my previous comment, I would:

* strongly consider using two different tables for "normal KDFs" and "password-based KDFs" because you would not want to use one where your would have to use the other;
* Consider removing "MD5-based KDFs" and "SHA-1-based KDFs" entries. The latter is in contradiction to the fact the PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-1 is listed as legacy.
